        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.085,
            0.578,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": "**Q2. Write the following fractions in ascending order. a.** $\\frac{7}{10}, \\frac{11}{15}, \\frac{2}{5}$ b. $\\frac{19}{24}, \\frac{5}{6}, \\frac{7}{12}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.151,
            0.317,
            0.224
          ],
          "content": "Ans. a. $\\frac { 2 } { 5 }   <   \\frac { 7 } { 1 0 }   <   \\frac { 1 1 } { 1 5 }$ b. $\\frac{7}{12} < \\frac{19}{24} < \\frac{5}{6}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.231,
            0.586,
            0.292
          ],
          "content": "**Q3. Write the following fractions in descending order. a.** $\\frac{25}{16}, \\frac{7}{8}, \\frac{13}{4}, \\frac{17}{32}$ b. $\\frac{3}{4}, \\frac{12}{5}, \\frac{7}{12}, \\frac{5}{4}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.296,
            0.351,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": "Ans. a. $\\frac{13}{4} > \\frac{25}{16} > \\frac{7}{8} > \\frac{17}{32}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.336,
            0.342,
            0.37
          ],
          "content": "b. $\\frac{12}{5} > \\frac{5}{4} > \\frac{3}{4} > \\frac{7}{12}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.403,
            0.146,
            0.423
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_46_image_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.406,
            0.247,
            0.423
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Section 7.8"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.434,
            0.232,
            0.451
          ],
          "content": "**Page no. 177**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.46,
            0.732,
            0.491
          ],
          "content": "**Q. Try adding** $\\frac { 4 } { 7 } + \\frac { 6 } { 7 }$ **using a number line. Do you get the same answer?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.507,
            0.16,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": "Ans."
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.5,
            0.235,
            0.531
          ],
          "content": "{ \\frac { 4 } { 7 } } + { \\frac { 6 } { 7 } }",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.538,
            0.346,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{4}{7} + \\frac{6}{7} = \\frac{10}{7} = 1 + \\frac{3}{7}",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_11.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.454,
            0.497,
            0.917,
            0.584
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_46_image_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.579,
            0.484,
            0.597
          ],
          "content": "Yes, using a number line, the answer is same."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.634,
            0.232,
            0.651
          ],
          "content": "**Page no. 179**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.658,
            0.146,
            0.679
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_46_image_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.662,
            0.247,
            0.679
          ],
          "content": "**Section 7.8**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.69,
            0.232,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": "**Figure it out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.717,
            0.66,
            0.735
          ],
          "content": "**Q1. Add the following fractions using Brahmagupta’s method:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.768,
            0.171,
            0.782
          ],
          "content": "a."
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.756,
            0.275,
            0.798
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{2}{7} + \\frac{5}{7} + \\frac{6}{7}",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_20.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.32,
            0.755,
            0.396,
            0.796
          ],
          "content": "b. $\\frac { 3 } { 4 } { + } \\frac { 1 } { 3 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.476,
            0.754,
            0.536,
            0.796
          ],
          "content": "\\frac { 2 } { 3 } + \\frac { 5 } { 6 }",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_22.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.816,
            0.231,
            0.858
          ],
          "content": "\\frac { 2 } { 3 } + \\frac { 2 } { 7 }",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_23.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.261,
            0.817,
            0.372,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{5}",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_24.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.392,
            0.816,
            0.46,
            0.858
          ],
          "content": "\\mathsf { f } . { \\frac { 2 } { 3 } }   +   { \\frac { 4 } { 5 } }",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_25.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.483,
            0.814,
            0.566,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": "\\text{。 } \\frac{4}{5}  +  \\frac{2}{3}",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_26.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.867,
            0.226,
            0.909
          ],
          "content": "\\mathsf { h } . { \\frac { 3 } { 5 } } \\mathsf { + } { \\frac { 5 } { 8 } }",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_27.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.252,
            0.867,
            0.324,
            0.909
          ],
          "content": "\\mathrm { i . }   \\frac { 9 } { 2 }   +   \\frac { 5 } { 4 }",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_28.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.36,
            0.867,
            0.421,
            0.909
          ],
          "content": "\\frac { 8 } { 3 } { + } \\frac { 2 } { 7 }",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_29.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.45,
            0.866,
            0.56,
            0.907
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{5}",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_30.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.926,
            0.29,
            0.968
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{4}{5} + \\frac{3}{7}",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_31.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.398,
            0.926,
            0.499,
            0.968
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{9}{2} + \\frac{5}{4} + \\frac{7}{6}",
          "image_source": "images/page_46_equation_32.jpg"
        }
      ]
    }
